  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A wave undergoes simple harmonic motion (SHM). The graph shows how the displacement of the particles in the medium varies with the distance along the wave. The time period of the wave is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"40\"></span> ms.</p>\n\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure>\n\n<p>What is the speed of the wave?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2.5\"></span> m s<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"5.0\"></span> m s<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"25\"></span> m s<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"50\"></span> m s<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
